#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:51
msgid ""
"Drive the shield through the :doc:`TVDisplay class </library/omv.tv>` "
"exposed by the :doc:`display module </library/omv.display>`. Stream camera "
"frames over the 5.8 GHz FPV downlink — ``IOCTL_CHANNEL`` selects which of "
"the eight Boscam channels (1–8) the transmitter uses::"
msgstr ""
"Controle o shield através da :doc:`classe TVDisplay </library/omv.tv>` "
"disponibilizada pelo :doc:`módulo display </library/omv.display>`\\ . "
"Transmita fotogramas da câmara pela ligação FPV de 5,8 GHz — "
"``IOCTL_CHANNEL`` seleciona qual dos oito canais Boscam (1–8) o transmissor "
"utiliza::"
